/// Ghost Train block — Upper/Lower A/B split. See rules/strength-authoring.md for the spec
/// this implements and strength/notes.md for the full design writeup.
///
/// DUMBBELL CONVERSION (2026-08-04): athlete's home gym has no barbell, only an adjustable
/// Bowflex SelectTech 552 pair (5-52.5lb per hand, 2.5lb increments) — home is the primary
/// training location for this block, so Squat, Bench Press, Bent Over Row, Overhead Press, and
/// Incline Bench Press are now the Dumbbell equipment variant. Romanian Deadlift has no Dumbbell
/// variant in Liftosaur's exercise list, so it's replaced with Stiff Leg Deadlift, Dumbbell (same
/// hip-hinge pattern, same equipment). The progression below is NOT a mechanical halving of the
/// old barbell numbers — it's redesigned to stay inside the SelectTech's 52.5lb/hand ceiling for
/// the whole block, since a naive halving would have exceeded it by Week 4 (peaks at 32.5lb/hand
/// on Squat/Stiff Leg Deadlift by Week 9, well inside range). Bulgarian Split Squat was already
/// dumbbell-equipment by default and is unchanged. Spot-verified via run_playground with real
/// complete_set() commands against weeks 1 and 9 before pushing.
///
/// Every week is fully self-contained (no reliance on Liftoscript's carry-forward mechanism —
/// see strength/notes.md for why). Weights are hand-authored conservative estimates, not measured
/// maxes; correct them from real sessions as they happen.

# Week 1

## Lower A — primary strength
main: Squat, Dumbbell / ! 3x5 / 2x5 / 1x5 / 20lb / 180s
main: Stiff Leg Deadlift, Dumbbell / ! 3x6 / 2x6 / 1x6 / 20lb / 150s
accessory: Bulgarian Split Squat / 3x8 / 30lb / 90s
core: Hanging Leg Raise / 3x10 / 0lb / 60s

## Upper A
main: Bench Press, Dumbbell / ! 3x5 / 2x5 / 1x5 / 15lb / 180s
main: Bent Over Row, Dumbbell / 3x8 / 15lb / 120s
accessory: Overhead Press, Dumbbell / 3x8 / 12.5lb / 90s
core: Pallof Press / 3x10 / 20lb / 60s

## Lower B — runner-specific, low fatigue
/// Single Leg Calf Raise is the highest-value accessory in the whole program for
/// ultra durability — protect this one when trimming volume, cut something else first.
accessory: Single Leg Calf Raise / 4x12 / 0lb / 60s
accessory: Nordic Curl / 3x6 / 0lb / 90s
accessory: Single Leg Deadlift / 3x10 / 25lb / 60s
accessory: Copenhagen Plank / 3x1 30s|30s
core: Dead Bug / 3x12 / 0lb / 45s

## Upper B
/// Champion Plan's Sunday flex day; paired with the easy/mod run.
main: Pull Up / ! 3x6 / 2x6 / 1x6 / 10lb / 150s / update: custom() {~
  if (setIndex == 0) {
    weights = bodyweight + originalWeights[ns]
  }
~}
main: Incline Bench Press, Dumbbell / 3x8 / 15lb / 120s
accessory: Face Pull / 3x15 / 30lb / 60s
core: Side Plank / 3x1 30s|30s

